<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IoT Pump Control Dashboard</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --primary: #38bdf8;
            --accent-on: #10b981;
            --accent-off: #ef4444;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .dashboard {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 900px;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        header {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #38bdf8, #818cf8);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .main-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .main-content {
                grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            }
        }

        .video-box {
            background: #020617;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 2px solid #334155;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            aspect-ratio: 4/3;
        }

        .video-box img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .control-panel {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #0f172a;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .guide-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .guide-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .badge {
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 10px;
            min-width: 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .badge-on {
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-on);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-on);
        }

        .badge-off {
            background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-off);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-off);
        }

        .footer-note {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="dashboard">
        <header>
            <h1>SMART PUMP ECO-SYSTEM</h1>
            <p>Hệ thống giám sát điều khiển máy bơm qua cử chỉ tay bằng AI</p>
        </header>

        <div class="main-content">
            <div class="video-box">
                <img src="{{ url_for('video_feed') }}" alt="Live Camera Stream">
            </div>

            <div class="control-panel">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">Kết nối phần cứng</div>
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;">
                        <span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; background-color: var(--accent-on); border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-right: 10px; box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-on);"></span>
                        Arduino UNO R3
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">Hướng dẫn cử chỉ</div>
                    <div class="guide-item">
                        <span class="badge badge-on">XÒE TAY</span>
                        <span>Bật bơm / Servo xoay 180°</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="guide-item">
                        <span class="badge badge-off">NẮM TAY</span>
                        <span>Tắt bơm / Servo về 0°</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="card" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b, #0f172a);">
                    <div class="card-title" style="color: #a5b4fc;">Chế độ xử lý</div>
                    <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #c7d2fe;">MediaPipe Hands AI</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-note">
            Đồ án hệ thống nhúng điều khiển thông minh ứng dụng Computer Vision © 2026
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
